BT /F1 10 Tf 54 738.0 Td (  with suppliers and partners.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 724.0 Td (- Accept - formally retain the residual risk where it is within appetite, with documented) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 710.0 Td (  rationale and time-bound review.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 696.0 Td (- Avoid - eliminate the risk by discontinuing the associated activity, system, or process.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 676.0 Td (Treatment progress is tracked to closure in the Risk Register, and the effectiveness of implemented) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 662.0 Td (controls is re-validated in the subsequent assessment to confirm that residual risk has been reduced) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 648.0 Td (to an acceptable level.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 622.0 Td (10. Governance and Review) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 599.0 Td (This policy is owned by the Global CISO and reviewed at least annually, or upon significant) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 585.0 Td (regulatory or business change. Exceptions require formal approval through the HPE Security Exception) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 571.0 Td (process. Non-compliance may result in disciplinary action consistent with HPE's Standards of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 557.0 Td (Business Conduct.) Tj ET
